{"metadata":{"role":"collection","modules":[{"name":"MollieComponents"}],"title":"MollieComponents","externalID":"MollieComponents","symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Accept card payments in your iOS app with a drop-in, PCI-aware payment UI — card tokenization and 3D Secure behind a single import."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/molliecomponents"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"anchor":"Getting-Started","title":"Getting Started","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckout"]},{"anchor":"Presenting","title":"Presenting","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckout","doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardComponent"]},{"anchor":"Results","title":"Results","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult","doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePayment"]},{"anchor":"Appearance","title":"Appearance","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/Theming"]},{"anchor":"Configuration","title":"Configuration","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieEndpoints"]},{"anchor":"Handling-Errors","title":"Handling Errors","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/HandlingErrors"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Structures","title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardFieldEvent"]},{"generated":true,"anchor":"Enumerations","title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardField","doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardFieldErrorKind","doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardScheme","doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckoutEvent"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"MollieComponents","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the merchant-facing entry point to the Mollie Components iOS SDK. You present a payment surface — modal or embedded — hand it a server-issued client access token, and receive a single typed ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult"},{"text":" describing how the flow ended. The card number and CVC the cardholder types are captured inside Mollie’s own UI and tokenized over TLS; they never cross the documented SDK boundary into your code. Your ","type":"text"},{"code":"onResult","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" callback receives only session metadata, never raw card data.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3D Secure is handled for you. When the issuer requires a challenge, the SDK presents the authentication WebView, drives it to a terminal state, and folds the outcome back into the same "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" you already handle — there is no separate 3DS callback to wire up."}]},{"name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK runs inside your app’s process. UIKit provides no platform-level isolation between your code and the SDK, so the protection of typed card data is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"contractual, not platform-enforced","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Read "},{"code":"SECURITY.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" at the repository root for the full trust model — what the SDK defends against, what it cannot enforce, and the integration practices your team must follow."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"important","type":"aside"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To get going in a few lines, see "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/GettingStarted","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". To map every outcome the SDK can hand back to merchant-facing behavior, see "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/HandlingErrors","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"references":{"doc://build.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/MollieCardField":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardField","abstract":[{"text":"Which field of the Mollie card form a ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardFieldEvent","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" refers to.","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MollieCardField"}],"title":"MollieCardField","url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/molliecardfield","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MollieCardField"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://build.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/HandlingErrors":{"url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/handlingerrors","role":"article","type":"topic","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Map every outcome the payment sheet can hand back to merchant-facing 